  keys not-keys ------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. george's authorized_keys has two$
# lines that are no key (a note, and a key cut short): they are$
# counted and the file named. His key is still listed.$
$
# SSH Keys #####################################################$
$
  Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Keys                 1 in 1 account$
  [ ] Not a key            2 lines$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Not a key$
      /home/george/.ssh/authorized_keys 2 lines$
   -  ED25519              george@laptop-1$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

